<title>USA: Spieker in $128.6 mln acquisition.</title>
<headline>Spieker in $128.6 mln acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spieker Properties Inc completed a $128.6 million of real estate investment in California and Oregon.</p>
<p>The acquisitions include approximately 810,000 square feet of office property for a total investment of $104.8 million, and approximately 430,000 square feet of industrial property for an investment of $23.8 million.</p>
</text>
